   "short": "GART",
   "aliases": [
    "glycinamide ribonucleotide transformylase",
    "phosphoribosylglycinamide formyltransferase"
   ],
   "notes": "First of two folate-dependent steps (C8 from N¹⁰-formyl-THF). Pemetrexed inhibits it (and thymidylate synthase, DHFR)."
  },
